    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BARRY AUCTIONEERS & VALUERS are delighted to present 8 Aylesbury, Ballintemple, Co. Cork to the market.\r\nThis exceptional four-bedroom, four-bathroom residence is presented in turnkey condition and offers a rare opportunity to acquire a stylish, energy-efficient family home in one of Cork’s most sought-after residential locations. Built in 2019 and meticulously maintained by its current owners, this contemporary property combines modern design, generous living accommodation, and superb convenience.\r\nExtending over three floors, the home is bright, spacious, and tastefully decorated throughout with a timeless neutral palette to suit a variety of interior styles.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hallway featuring elegant wall panelling and a striking herringbone floor finish, which flows seamlessly throughout the level. A generously proportioned living room enjoys excellent natural light, while the open-plan kitchen/dining area has been thoughtfully designed to combine both functionality and style. The contemporary fitted kitchen features sleek cabinetry, quality countertops, and integrated appliances, with double sliding doors opening onto the rear garden — ideal for both everyday living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nOff the kitchen is a fully fitted utility room complete with extensive storage, presses, and shelving. A stylish guest WC completes the ground floor, enhanced by bold jungle-themed wallpaper & grandfather clock which adds a unique sense of character and charm to the home. The jungle will be staying, the clock will not!!\r\nThe first floor hosts two beautifully appointed bedrooms, including a spacious principal bedroom with built-in wardrobes and a modern ensuite bathroom. A luxurious four-piece family bathroom, complete with bathtub and separate shower, serves this floor. The large landing area also incorporates a practical home office space along with additional storage.\r\n\r\nThe top floor continues the home’s impressive standard of finish, offering two further spacious bedrooms and an additional bathroom, making it an ideal layout for growing families, guests, or flexible work-from-home arrangements.\r\n\r\nThis property boasts an impressive A2 BER rating, reflecting the excellent build quality, superior insulation, and energy-efficient features throughout, including an air-to-water heat pump and high-performance glazing. The result is year-round comfort, reduced energy costs, and sustainable modern living.\r\nSituated within a quiet and modern development, 8 Aylesbury enjoys a superb location just moments from Ballintemple Village. Residents benefit from close proximity to excellent schools, shops, cafés, sporting facilities, and a wide range of local amenities including the Marina Market, Páirc Uí Chaoimh, and the Blackrock Greenway. Cork City Centre is only minutes away, while nearby bus routes 215 and 215A provide direct and convenient access to the city.\r\n\r\nThis is a truly turnkey home offering contemporary comfort, energy efficiency, and an unbeatable location in one of Cork’s most desirable suburbs.\r\n\r\nAPPROXIMATE DISTANCES:\r\n•\tBus Stop: 500m\r\n•\tDouglas Village: 1.7 km\r\n•\tMahon Golf Club: 2 km\r\n•\tBlackrock Village: 2.5 km\r\n•\tCork City Centre: 3.3 km\r\n•\tKent Train Station: 4.2 km\r\n•\tUCC: 5.5 km\r\n•\tApple HQ: 8.2 km\r\n•\tCork Airport: 8.4 km\r\n•\tCUH: 8.5 km"
      },
      {
