        "Content": "Ground Floor - \r\n\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway - 7.26m x 1.19m \r\nHerringbone flooring. Panelled walls.\r\n\r\nFront Reception Room - 3.84m x 4.74m \r\nHerringbone flooring. Electric fireplace.\r\n\r\nDownstairs WC - 1.76m x 1.43m \r\n2-piece suite with herringbone flooring.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Room - \r\nHerringbone flooring. Fridge and freezer, double oven, induction hob, dishwasher, island unit of 2.2m x 1.1m.\r\n\r\nUtility Room - 1.75m x 1.72m \r\nHerringbone flooring.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor - \r\n\r\n\r\nLanding/Office - 3.75m x 2.19m \r\nCarpeted. Built-in storage.\r\n\r\nBathroom 1 - 2.77m x 1.74m \r\n4-piece suite with bath and shower. Radiator.\r\n\r\nMain Bedroom (1) - 3.71m x 4.48m \r\nCarpeted, radiator, and built-in storage.\r\n\r\nEnsuite (1) - 1.84m x 1.76m \r\n3-piece suite. Tiled. Radiator.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 2.75m x 5.17m \r\nTimber flooring. Built-in storage. Radiator. Double doors to balcony.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 5.16m x 2.59m \r\nTimber flooring. Built-in storage. Radiator.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 - 3.3m x 5.08m \r\nTimber flooring. Built-in storage. Radiator.\r\n\r\nBathroom 2 - \r\n3-piece suite with a shower. Tiled.\r\n\r\n"
